  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## CommunityConnect: record an announcement by phone\n\n1. In **Config (voice)** paste your Twilio Auth Token (the same one as in the texting workflow).\n2. **voiceWebhookUrl** must be exactly the **Production URL** of *Twilio Incoming Call* (it already is, unless your n8n address is different).\n3. Save, then **Publish**.\n4. In Twilio, set your number's **A call comes in** to that Production URL (HTTP POST).\n\nTexters call the number, choose a group by keypad, record, listen back and press 1. Everyone in the group gets a phone call that plays the recording (sent by the texting workflow).",
